     ing if this is to work.  _H_a_s_m_n_t_o_p_t scans the _m_n_t__o_p_t_s field
     of the _m_n_t_e_n_t structure _m_n_t for a substring that matches
     _o_p_t.  It returns the address of the substring if a match is



